@RegistroEstudianteBack_HostAddress = http://localhost:5010

GET {{RegistroEstudianteBack_HostAddress}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{RegistroEstudianteBack_HostAddress}}/health

### Registro público: siempre crea un estudiante
POST {{RegistroEstudianteBack_HostAddress}}/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana",
  "lastName": "Perez",
  "email": "ana@example.test",
  "password": "Ejemplo-local-123!",
  "identificationType": "CedulaCiudadania",
  "identificationNumber": "100000001"
}

### Login: devuelve accessToken, tokenType, expiresAtUtc y user
POST {{RegistroEstudianteBack_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@example.test",
  "password": "Ejemplo-local-123!"
}

### Copiar el accessToken del login
@accessToken = REEMPLAZAR_POR_EL_TOKEN

GET {{RegistroEstudianteBack_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Solo Admin (Student recibe 403)
GET {{RegistroEstudianteBack_HostAddress}}/api/Role
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Modificar mi perfil (no acepta cambios de rol o estado)
PUT {{RegistroEstudianteBack_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Maria",
  "lastName": "Perez",
  "email": "ana@example.test",
  "identificationType": "CedulaCiudadania",
  "identificationNumber": "100000001"
}

### Cambiar mi contraseña: el token actual deja de ser válido
PUT {{RegistroEstudianteBack_HostAddress}}/api/users/me/password
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "Ejemplo-local-123!",
  "newPassword": "Nueva-clave-local-456!"
}

### Token obtenido mediante login de un administrador
@adminToken = REEMPLAZAR_POR_TOKEN_ADMIN
@userId = 1

### Listar usuarios; filtros opcionales Search, Role y Active
GET {{RegistroEstudianteBack_HostAddress}}/api/users?PageNumber=1&PageSize=20&Role=Professor&Active=true
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Consultar un usuario
GET {{RegistroEstudianteBack_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Crear un profesor (solo Admin)
POST {{RegistroEstudianteBack_HostAddress}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laura",
  "lastName": "Lopez",
  "email": "laura@example.test",
  "password": "Clave-profesor-123!",
  "identificationType": "CedulaCiudadania",
  "identificationNumber": "100000002",
  "role": "Professor"
}

### Actualizar datos y rol de un usuario
PUT {{RegistroEstudianteBack_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laura",
  "lastName": "Lopez",
  "email": "laura@example.test",
  "identificationType": "CedulaCiudadania",
  "identificationNumber": "100000002",
  "role": "Professor"
}

### Desactivar conservando los datos
DELETE {{RegistroEstudianteBack_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Reactivar
PATCH {{RegistroEstudianteBack_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{userId}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
